                                "sense_id": "49c03bb1-15ce-3be4-bbac-d214e42a2fe5",
                                "text": "Equatorial Andean butterfly faunas are both absolutely and relatively impoverished in comparison to both temperate oreal (high-mountain) faunas and adjacent lowland ones. Why should this be so?"
                            },
